  "content": "<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af67364e6961c7d301f6af56d97221dfb4206f09.png\" alt=\"极乐补丁横幅_Memokii创作\">\n</div>\n<br>\n</a><div style=\"display:flex;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-白色?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=rgb(149, 74, 195)&amp;labelColor=f091f6&amp;color=rgb(4, 11, 20)&amp;link=ttps://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3XF\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fchangelogs%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"更新日志\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/更新日志-白色?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=rgb(149, 74, 195)&amp;labelColor=f091f6&amp;color=rgb(4, 11, 20)&amp;link=https://github.com/EuphoriaPatches/Changelogs\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"极乐补丁\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/极乐补丁-050b14?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=googlechrome&amp;logoColor=8d50bf&amp;label=官方网站&amp;labelColor=e797f3\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"支持\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/spaceagle17 - 黑色?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon&amp;label=支持&amp;labelColor=黑色&amp;color=f091f6\">\n    </a>\n</div><h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/437130f3f10997f720ff0b788cb24cde3b3b8541.png\" alt=\"极乐补丁logo\" width=\"30\" height=\"auto\"> &nbsp; Complementray着色器扩展包</h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8e7b00cde9ddb9c5b8aa2132f65e46b634f3cb8c.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n</div>\n</a><br><ul>\n<li><strong>极乐补丁</strong>，Complementary着色器（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>重新构想版</ins></a>/<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>无约束版</ins></a>）的扩展包，由<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinktr.ee%252fSpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SpacEagle17</a>开发。</li>\n<li>为Complementary着色器增加可选的手工制作功能，扩展其能力。</li>\n<li>所有选项默认关闭，但可单独开启。<br>\n提供了\"常用设置\"选项卡和预设配置，方便一键应用常用选项。</li>\n</ul><strong>重要通知：使用此扩展包时若遇到任何问题，请勿向Emin报告，联系信息见下方。</strong><h2>📥 安装方法：</h2><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fhow-to-install\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>euphoriapatches.com/how-to-install/</ins></a></strong><h2>🔗 相关链接</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Patreon</ins></a>上支持SpacEagle17，获取预览版本访问权限！</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>官方网站</ins></a></strong> 极乐补丁官网！</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fchangelogs%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>更新日志</ins></a></strong> 极乐补丁更新记录！</li>\n<li><strong>联系方式：</strong> <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252fcontact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://euphoriapatches.com/contact</a></strong></li>\n<li>为极乐补丁添加<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fproperties%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>模组方块</ins></a></strong>或<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252flang%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>翻译文件</ins></a></strong>！</li>\n</ul><h2>❓ 常见问题</h2><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252ffaq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>euphoriapatches.com/faq/</ins></a></strong><h2>由Ember Host赞助</h2><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EUPHORIA</a></strong><strong>10%</strong><strong>50%</strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.euphoriapatches.com/assets/img/other/ember_host_ep.png\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fcredits%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.euphoriapatches.com/credits/</a>",
